WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.474
Welcome to Orbit. Better choices. Our focus is Comparatives and superlatives.

2
00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:15.852
Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group.

3
00:00:15.852 --> 00:00:19.240
This is the most interesting book in the library.

4
00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.010
The train is faster than the bus.

5
00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:25.079
The red bag is lighter than the blue one.

6
00:00:25.079 --> 00:00:34.477
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
